draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123860","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123860.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123860.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRemoves dead code I noticed while working on something else.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\nNo behavior change expected.\r\n\r\n`parse_tag_assign_eof` clears the `r_assign` argument at the start, so there is no reason to assign `Variant()` to it before the call.  The `assign` variable is not used between assigning `Variant()` and calling the function so it's safe to remove.\r\n\r\nThe `r_assign = \"\"` line was added in 2016  in 5bf25e46be and just a day later `assign = Variant()` was used in 4e367a4b7b\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46173009dc4ab6e582cf978e2d68b0ddfeb1e934/core/variant/variant_parser.cpp#L1769-L1771 \r\nI think the code was just copied around afterwards and this was missed.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123860/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123860/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}